      "item_id": "RX-BICARB-84-50",
      "decision": "covered",
      "reason": "The recall explicitly lists NDC 00409-6637-14 (case) and 00409-6637-24 (carton). Our product RX-BICARB-84-50 has NDC 00409-6637-14 and matches the recalled product description (8.4% Sodium Bicarbonate Injection, USP 50mEq/50 mL, Hospira, Lifeshield syringe). The unit NDC 00409-6637-24 is contained within our package, confirming coverage."
    },
    {
      "item_id": "RX-BICARB-84-50-FK",
      "decision": "not_covered",
      "reason": "This product is manufactured by Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC, and is not part of the Pfizer/Hospira recall. Its NDC 63323-0089-50 and presentation (50 mL single-dose vial in tray) differ entirely from the recalled product. The recall's openFDA family count of 4 applies only to the Pfizer/Hospira product family."
    }
  ]
}
